    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "Natural spawning. spawn.biomes mixes a biome tag (#minecraft:is_forest, every forest) and a single biome (minecraft:plains); the mob spawns in all of them. weight is its share among the other creatures of those biomes: cows and sheep have 12 and pigs 10, so 10 makes it about as common as pigs. Groups have two to four hoppers. placement on_ground, heightmap motion_blocking_no_leaves and rule mob are the defaults, written out here: on solid ground, under the open sky or tree tops, with the usual light check.",
